<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">AEFESO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aefeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Aefeso</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aefeso</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa Aefeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua kwa Aefeso yaandikilwe munsimu gumo na balua ya kwa Akolosai mumwaka wa 60 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu. Mwandiki aitapa mwene panga Pauli Ntumilwe (1:1). Asomi baingi bendayi'ki'tya panga Pauli aandike balua kwa Akolosai, pamope no panga balua yo ntu'pu' pandu pa salamu yake mwene kati mwaibile kwa Akolosai. Kwa kitumbu si' iwesa panga yabinilwe iti'li'te nkati ya makanisa nsi'si' gagaabile mumuyi wo. Kai' Pauli aawanikia panga nsimu waandikage balua yo aabile muutabilwe (3:1, 4:1, na 6:20). Pauli atumike balua yo kwa luboko lwa Tikiko paalityangili kanisa lya Efeso (6:21).</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso waai nga muyi nku'lu' na kitamo kiku'lu' sa utawala wa Kiroma mu Asia Njene. Efeso kwaatanganikwe muno kwa kitumbu sa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' yayaabile mo no bi'ki'lwa wakupu na nnu'ngu' nnwawa wa Kiyunani wawaakemilwe Atemi (Makowe ga Atumilwe 19:23). Kanisa lya Efeso lyaatumbwi kwa makakala lakini nnu'ngi' lyaatikwilibalya (Uumukwo 2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli atumbwa longolya aawanikia nusu ya balua yi'no bu'kana na Nnu'ngu' mwaasawi bandu na kwakosopolya bu'ka mumasambi gabe kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu. Alilandanisa kanisa na yi'ga, na Kilisitu kati ntwe wake, kai' alilandanisa kanisa na nyumba, na Kilisitu nga kati liwe liku'lu' lya pakitumembe lya nyumba yo. Na nusu yeneibi'li' ya kitabu si' Pauli aawanikia mwaipalikwa tama mumaisa ga Kikilisitu. <figure style="fig" alt="Cornerstone - GT00082" file="Cornerstone2_Luke20.17_GT00082.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="1:0" /></para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pauli endakwitapa no piya salamu kwa Aefeso <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:12">1:12</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Aawanikia umope wa kanisa na Kilisitu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3-3:21</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Pauli aandika ku'no kalaya mwaipalikwa tama kwa Akilisitu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 4:16-20">4:16-20</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Pauli apiya mayi'gi'yo go yomolya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Balua yi'no niiandike nenga na Pauli, ntumilwe bu'kana na mwapendi Nnu'ngu'. Nimwandikyanga mwaapeleteu ba Nnu'ngu' akwo Efeso, mwamuu'bi'like muulu'mbani na Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Tunnu'bya ngu'ngu' na amani bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu, na kwa Bwana Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balaka ya kiloo mu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Alumbilwe Nnu'ngu', Tati' ba Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu. Kwa kitumbu so lu'mbana kwitu na Kilisitu, Nnu'ngu' atupei balaka yoti ya kiloo yaibile kunani. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kubile balo umbilwa kwa dunia, Nnu'ngu' aatusawi tupange twabake muulu'mbani na Kilisitu li'nga tube twapeleteu na twangali baa na kipi'li' nnu'ngi' yake. Kwa kitumbu sa upendo wake, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />aalongoli kutusawa tupange twabana bake kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu, kwa pulaa na kwo penda mwene. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Kwa nyo tunsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa ngu'ngu' yake ya ayabu, yaatupei wabule kwa ndi'la ya Mwana wake ywampendile, Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Nnu'ngu' atukombwi kwa ndi'la ya myai yake, lombolya nsama wa sambi, bu'kana na uyolou wa ngu'ngu' yake. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Ywembe aatuyongekiye muno ngu'ngu' yake pamope na ikima na utangi. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Nnu'ngu' aatupangite tuitange iyo yaiyite ya galu' gaagapendile. Aapangite nyo li'nga ayomoli panga gaabinile kwo pi'tya kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Makowe ga Nnu'ngu' gaalu'a yomolelya nsimu pawaatimya, nga palu' paalu'a lu'mbaniya pamope yumbe yoti na kila kili'be sa kunani na padunia no baa pai' ya utawala wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Nnu'ngu' aapangite kila kili'be bu'kana na mabinio na mwapendi mwene. Ywembe aatusawi kwa kitumbu so lu'mbana kwitu na Kilisitu pala tube twabandu bake. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Kwa nyo twenga twatulongoli kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu, tupalikwa kuulumba utukupu wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Na mwenga mwabandu bangali Ayahudi, mwaiyu'wine Abali Inannoga yayaanneti ukosopoli, na kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu. Naywembe Nnu'ngu', li'nga laya panga mwenga mwabake, ammi'kite muuli kwa kumpeyanga Loo Mpeleteu ywaatulagile. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Aywo Loo nga kitomelelyo situ so pata kila kili'be sa Nnu'ngu' saalagi bandu bake, na likowe li' litukong'ondelya panga Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kwakombwa boti bababile bake. Tuulumbe utukupu wake!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sala ya Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Kwa kitumbu so, bu'ka panaayu'wine bu'kana na imani yinu kwa Kilisitu Yesu na upendo winu kwa apeleteu boti, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />ninakotokali kunsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sinu. Nendakunku'mbu'kyanga mumalu'bo gangu'. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ninnu'ba Nnu'ngu' wa Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu, annyalyange Loo wa ikima na amuumukuli li'nga mupate kuntanga muno. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Ninnu'ba Nnu'ngu' aiyu'we myoyo yinu ipate kuubona bweya wake. Kwa nyo mwaalu'a litanga liu'bi'lyo lyamubile nalyo bu'kana na nkemo wa Nnu'ngu'. Kai' mupate tanga utayili nku'lu' wa ulisi waubi'kilwe kwa apeleteu bake, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />na uweso wake nku'lu' wangali li'ngi'li'lya kwa kitumbu situ twenga twatuu'bi'lya. Uweso wo nga waupanga kasi nkati yitu, na ngawaulandana na galu' makakala maku'lu' muno, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />gaagatumile nsimu wa kunnyu'ya Kilisitu bu'ka kuuwi'li, na kuntamika kuluboko lwake lwamalyo akwo kunani. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Akwo Kilisitu atawala kila utawala, makakala, lenji, na uku'lu', atawala bu'kana na kila lina lyaliwesa kemelwa padunia yi'no na padunia yayaaisa. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Nnu'ngu' ampei Kilisitu utawala wa ili'be yoti, na kummi'ka panga ntwe wa likanisa. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Likanisa nga yi'ga ya Kilisitu na kutwi'li timilika kwake. Ywembe ngatimilisa kila kili'be na kila pandu.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Bu'ka mukiwo sa kiloo no yingya muukoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Patumbu mwenga mwaawile kiloo, kwa kitumbu sa makosa na masambi ginu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Mutamage kwa kuukoleya nnyendo mwakau wa padunia yi'no, na kunnyu'wa Ibilisi, ntawala wa moka ga kumaunde ywatawala nambi'yambi' bandu bangali kunnyu'wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Ata twaboti twaai kati bembe, twaatami kwo koleya maminyikiyo ga payi'ga na kugapanga makowe gagapendelwa na yi'ga na malango gitu. Kwa ali yitu ya kiyi'ga, twaapalikwe kwipata nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' kati bi'ngi'. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Lakini Nnu'ngu' nga mwene kiya sambone, na aatupendi kwa upendo wangayomoka. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Ata mana twaabile twawaa kwa kitumbu sa masambi gitu, aatuyu'yite pamope na Kilisitu. Kwa nyo, tukosopolilwe kwa ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Kwo lu'mbana na Kilisitu Yesu, Nnu'ngu' aatituu'bu'ya na kututamika pamope nakwe li'nga tukatawale pamope kunani. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Aapangite nyo li'nga laya unogau wake kwitu munsimu wawisa pi'tya Kilisitu Yesu, na uyolou wa ngu'ngu' yake yangayomoka. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Kwa mwanjaa, mukosopolilwe kwa ngu'ngu', kwa ndi'la ya imani wala kwa yendo yinu inannogali. Yi'no nga upo bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Ankosopoli lili kwa iyendo yinu, kwa nyo mundu aakane kwilumba. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Nnu'ngu' nga ywatupangite tube kati mwatubile. Aatuumbite mpya mu Kilisitu Yesu li'nga tupange makowe manogau mumaisa gitu, makowe gaatubi'kile tugapange.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umope mu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Kwa nyo muku'mbu'ki panga patumbu mwaabelekwi mubile mwa Ayahudi lili, ila mwabandu bangali Ayahudi. Na bankemage “Mwangainilwa” na bembe Ayahudi baaikemite “Ainilwa” kwo bu'kana no inilwa kwabe kwakupangilwa muyi'ga kwa moko ga bandu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Muku'mbu'ki panga patumbu mwaabileli na Kilisitu. Na mwaabileli mwabandu ba Baisilaili, mwaatangiteli masikisano ga malagano gaabi'i Nnu'ngu' kwa bandu bake. Mwabileli na liu'bi'lyo wala mwaantangiteli Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Lakini nambi'yambi' kwo lu'mbana kwinu na Kilisitu Yesu, mwenga mwamwaabile kuutalu muletilwe papipi kwa ndi'la ya myai yake. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Kwa mwanjaa Kilisitu mwene nga ywaatuleti amani kwo panga Ayahudi na bandu bangali Ayahudi babe amope. Aabu'yite undumu waubile kati kingu'mbi' pakati yitu. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Ywembe aaputike salya ya Ayahudi pamope na amuli na malagyo gake. Apangite nyo li'nga kwapanga bandu bano ba ngolo ibi'li' babe lukolo lumo. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kwa yi'ga yake, Kilisitu aaulangamise undumu wabe, kwa nsalaba aailu'mbaniye ngolo ibi'li' ya bandu ibe lukolo lumo na kwaawana na Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="EPH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Apo Kilisitu aaisi kwa kitumbu so ala Abali Inannoga ya amani kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi babaabile kuutalu na Nnu'ngu' na kwa Ayahudi babaabile papipi na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Kwa mwanjaa, kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu twenga twaboti, Ayahudi na bandu bangali Ayahudi, tupatike ndi'la ya kwayendelya Tati' kwa Loo yumo.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Bai nambi'yambi' mwenga mwagenili wala mwapi'ta ndi'lali, ila muyu'kite mwabenekaya pamope na apeleteu, na kai' mwaalongo mulukolo lwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Musengilwe munsingi waubi'kilwe na atumilwe na alondoli ba Nnu'ngu', naywembe Kilisitu mwene nga liwe liku'lu' lya nsingi. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Kwa ywembe, nyumba yoti ilu'mbaniyilwe wiso no yi'mi'ki'lwa ata ipange nyumba mbeleteu kwa Bwana. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Kwo lu'mbana nakwe, mwenga mulu'mbaniyilwe pamope na bi'ngi' boti no pangilwa potamo wa Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya Loo wake.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Lyengo lya Pauli kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Bu'kana na go, nenga na Pauli nendakunnu'bya. Nenga nantabilwe kwa kitumbu sa lyengo lyaanipei Yesu Kilisitu kwinu, mwabandu bangali Ayahudi. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Niibona mutangite panga, kwa ngu'ngu' yake Nnu'ngu' aanikamukiye lyengo lya kumwaalya mwenga Abali Inannoga, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />yani yi'lu' iyo yaiumukulilwe kwangu' nenga kati mwanilongoli andika. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Kwo soma gano muwesa tanga mu'lu' mwaniitangite iyo ya mabinio ga Nnu'ngu' kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Kwai'mbu' bandu baabakiyilweli iyo yo, lakini nambi'yambi' Nnu'ngu' aabakiye atumilwe na alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' apeleteu, kwa ndi'la ya Loo. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Iyo yene nga yi'no, kwa ndi'la ya Injili bandu bangali Ayahudi bapata pandu pabe pabalaka ya Nnu'ngu' pamope na Ayahudi. Bembe nga ili'mbi'li'mbi' ya yi'ga yi'yi'lu'yi'lu' na bapanga kiselele mulilagano li'li'lu'li'lu' lyalipangite Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Nenga nipangilwe na ntumilwe wa Injili kwa ngu'ngu' yaniyali Nnu'ngu' kwa uweso wake nku'lu'. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Nenga nansene kulikoni bandu boti ba Nnu'ngu', lakini Nnu'ngu' aniyali ngu'ngu' ngu'lu' ya kwaalya bandu bangali Ayahudi Abali Inannoga ya Kilisitu, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />na kumumukulya kila mundu iyo yayaaiyilwe na Nnu'ngu' ywaumbike ili'be yoti bu'ka kwai'mbu'. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Li'nga nambi'yambi' kwa ndi'la ya kanisa, ikima yoti ya Nnu'ngu' ipate tanganikwa kwa atawala na bene makakala ga kunani. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Nnu'ngu' aapangite likowe lyo bu'kana no binia kwake kwangaliyomoka kwaapangite kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu Bwana witu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Bai, kwo lu'mbana kwitu na Yesu Kilisitu kwa ndi'la ya kumwu'bi'lya, tupeyelwa ndi'la yo ika nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' pangali yogopa. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Kwa nyo, ninnu'banga kanemuti'kwanike mwoyo kwa mwanjaa, niipata ngu'su'mbu' kwa kitumbu sinu na ngayainnetya isima.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Upendo wa Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Bai, kwa kitumbu sa makowe ago goti, ninkilikitya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />Ywembe nga Tati' ba ili'be yoti yaibile padunia na kunani. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Ninnu'ba Nnu'ngu' kwa uyolou wa utukupu wake, annyali makakala li'nga mube mwakangamau mumyoyo yinu kwa ndi'la ya Loo wake, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />li'nga Kilisitu apate tama mumyoyo yinu kwa ndi'la ya imani. Nanenga nilu'ba panga namwenga mube na ndandai kai' ngangamau kwa nsingi wa upendo. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Mube na uweso wo tanga pamope na apeleteu boti mu'lu' mwaulandala upendo wa Kilisitu, kwo panuka, ulaso, kyi'mo no yendekeya, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />na kuutanga upendo wu'no waupi'ta utangi wa bandu boti, li'nga mupate twi'li'yi'lwa no ikya kukili'ngo so timilika kwoti kwa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Bai, kwa ywembe ywawesa panga makowe ga ayabu gangali li'ngi'ka kulikoni goti gatugalu'ba au gatugawasa kwo bu'kana na uweso wake wu'lu' waupanga kasi nkati yitu, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />ywembe alumbilwe mulikanisa na mu Kilisitu Yesu kwa lubelekwo lwoti, milele na milele. Amina.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Umope wa aumini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Bai, nenga nanibile nantabilwe kwa kitumbu sa kuntumikia Bwana, ninnu'banga mutame kati mwaipalikwa bu'kana na nkemo wankemite Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />kwo gegekea kwoti no tu'lya, komeya, no pu'tu'lyana kwo pendana. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Mukasane kondeya umope wa Loo, kwo lu'mbaniyilwa muamani. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Twenga twaboti tubile twayi'ga yimo na Loo yumo kati mu'lu' mwatukemilwe na Nnu'ngu' muliu'bi'lyo limo. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Kai', kubile na Bwana yumo, imani yimo, na ubatiso umo, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Nnu'ngu' yumo ywembe nga Tati' ywa boti, abile panani ya goti, apanga kasi pi'tya twenga twaboti, na nkati ya boti.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Lakini kila yumo ywitu apeyilwe ngu'ngu' bu'kana na kili'ngo saayalilwe na Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Paau'bu'ki kunani muno, aayi'i na atabilwe pamope nakwe, aapei bandu upo.”</char> <verse eid="EPH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Bai, tubaye panga <char style="qt">“Paau'bu'ki kunani,”</char> ilombolya namani? Ilombolya panga Kilisitu paabile balo yenda kunani auluki wi'ti' pai' padunia. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Kwa nyo, Kilisitu aauluki pai', na ngaywau'bu'ki kunani. Aayi'i kunani ya kunani muno li'nga awese baa kila pandu. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ywembe ngaywaasawi bi'ngi' panga atumilwe, bi'ngi' alondoli ba Nnu'ngu', bi'ngi' aali ba Abali Inannoga ya Yesu Kilisitu, bi'ngi' asungi na balimu. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Ywembe aapangite nyalu' kwa kitumbu sa kwabi'ka wiso bandu ba Nnu'ngu' kwa lyengo lyo tumika, li'nga yi'ga ya Kilisitu ipate kangamala, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />mpaka twaboti patwauikya umope muimani kwa kuntanga muno Mwana wa Nnu'ngu' no panga mwabandu akomala kwo ika mukyi'mo so kamilika kwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Kwa nyo, twaapangali kai' kati twabana, katupepetuka no utilwa na mayi'gano ga kila sampuli gagaletelwa na bandu babaakonga ayabe na kwaobeya kwa ubu'su' wabe. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Lakini mana katubakiana kweli kwa mwoyo wa upendo, tukangamala mumakowe goti na kumwikya Kilisitu, ywembe nga ntwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Ywembe aalu'mbaniya bandu bake boti bapanga amope, kati mu'lu' ili'mbi'li'mbi' yoti ya payi'ga, mwailu'mbaniyilwa no kamuyilwa pamope ku'no kila kili'mbi'li'mbi' kakipanga lyengo lyake. Ali', ngaliipanga yi'ga yoti iku'le no sengeka muupendo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maisa gayambi' mu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Bai, kwa lina lya Bwana nimmu'langa nnyanya, kanemutame kai' kati mwabatama bandu bangali Ayahudi bababi'ngi'ya mawaso gabe gangali pwaika. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Bandu bo malango gabe gatwi'li lubi'ndu' na babaulilwe kuutalu na Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sa ulalo wabe waubu'kana no nonopa kwa myoyo yabe. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Baibonali oni ata pasene, baiyingiye musampuli yoti ya maminyikiyo no panga makowe goti malau pangali li'ngi'lya.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Lakini mwenga mwiyi'ganiyeli nyo bu'kana na Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Niu'bi'lya panga, mwayu'wine wiso bu'kana na Yesu na ukweli wake. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Mwayi'ganilwe kuula nnyendo winu wa kwai'mbu' na umundu winu wa kibelekwe waualabike na maminyikio gake ga ukongi, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />li'nga mupangilwe mwayambi' muloo na maganio ginu. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Kai', muwale maisa gayambi' kati mu'lu' mwamumbike Nnu'ngu' no landana nakwe, mubile mwabene aki ya kweli na upeleteu.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Kwa nyo, muuleke ubu'su', <char style="qt">kila mundu alongele kweli kwa nnyine, </char> kwa mwanjaa twenga twaboti twaili'mbi'li'mbi' ya yi'ga yimo. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" /><char style="qt">Pamuusika, kanemupange sambi, </char> kanemusinde lisu'ba lyoti mwausika. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Usika kumpanga Ibilisi apate lipala lya kukusopa. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Mwii, kaneayibe kai', ila apange kasi kwa moko gake mwene li'nga abe na kili'be sa kwapeya apali. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Kanemulongele makowe gogoti maakau, ila mulongele makowe gagayangatia kwasenga bi'ngi' bai, no leta pwaila kwa balu' babagayu'wa. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Wala kanemumusunise Loo Mpeleteu wa Nnu'ngu', kwake ywembe mwayi'yilwe muuli kwa lisu'ba lyo kosopolelwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Mutaikuli kuutalu na mwenga mabinio goti ga undumu, nyongo, mayu'mano, na maku'pi'ki'yano ga ulau. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Ila mube mwanogamwoyo, no bi'kyana kiya, kila mundu ansami nnyine kati mu'lu' Nnu'ngu' mwansami mwenga kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Tama mubweya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwabana ba Nnu'ngu' mwamupendilwe muno, munnyige ywembe. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Mutame maisa go pendana kati mu'lu' Kilisitu mwatupendi twenga na kwipiya kwa kitumbu situ panga salaka yene lumba lunannungya kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Lakini upege kaneuyu'wanike pakati yinu, wala usapu wa sampuli yoyoti, wala minyikia, kwa mwanjaa makowe ga gapalikwa gabe kuutalu na apeleteu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Wala kanekube na malongelo masapu ga oni, au makowe ga kilogeloge au ga nsalango gangali pwaika, ila ipalikwa mayi'gi'yo ginu gansukulu Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Kwa abali ya makowe ga, mutange kweli panga mpege, wala mundu nnau, wala ywaminyikia (mundu kati ywo aikilikitya inyago), katu aauyingyali ukulungwa wa Kilisitu na wa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Kanemuyi'ki'ti kongelwa na mundu ywoywoti kwa mayi'gi'yo gake gabule, kwa mwanjaa nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' iyaka kwa makowe kati ga kwa balu' bangali kunnyu'wa. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Kwa nyo, kanemupange kiselele na bandu kati bo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Kwa mwanjaa, kwai'mbu' mwenga mwaai mulubi'ndu', lakini nambi'yambi' mubile mubweya kwa kitumbu sa Bwana. Bai, muyendeli tama kati mwabana ba bweya. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Kwa mwanjaa, bweya wu', uleta sampuli yoti ya unogau, aki, na kweli. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Mukasane pala tanga no panga makowe gagampulaisa Bwana Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Kanemupange kiselele na makowe ga mulubi'ndu' gangali pwaika, ila mugaumukwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Kakape, makowe gagapangika kwa iyo na bandu alau, ga oni ata kugalongela pankano. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Lakini kila kili'be mana kiumukulilwe pabweya, sendatanganikwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Kwa mwanjaa bweya ngaukipanga kila kikowe kibonekane, ngamo ibayilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Uyumuke wenga waugonjike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">uyu'yi'lwe bu'ka kwa awi'li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Nembe Kilisitu aalu'a kumulikya.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Kwa nyo, mulinguli muno mu'lu' mwamutama. Kanemupange kati mwabapanga bandu bangali ikima, lakini mutame kati mwabene ikima. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Mwikase tumya kila lipala lyamubile nalyo kwo panga manogau, kwa mwanjaa masu'ba gano gamubile nago, ga ulau. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Kwa nyo kanemube mwalogeloge, lakini mugatange gagapala Bwana Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Kai' kanemulobi wi'mbi' kwa mwanjaa, lobya kumpanga mundu apange makowe ga oni. Mwaipalikwa, mwenga mutwi'li'yi'lwe na Loo Mpeleteu. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Pamupanga kyenga, mugatambwe mayi'gi'yo ga Zabuli, myambo, na tenzi ya muloo, munnyi'mbi Bwana kwa myambo ya Zabuli no sukulu mumyoyo yinu. Munnyi'mbi na kumwu'pi'lya Bwana kwa myoyo yinu yoti. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Mwasukulu Tati' bitu Nnu'ngu' masu'ba goti kwa kila kikowe kwa lina lya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alwawa na analu'me bababile mundoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Kila mundu agegekeye kwa nnyine kwa isima yatubilenayo kwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Alwawa baagegekeye akinasengo babe, kati kunnyu'wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Kwa mwanjaa nnalu'me nga ntwe wa nnyumbowe, kati mwaibile Kilisitu nga ntwe wa kanisa. Kilisitu nga nkosopoli wa kanisa na lyembe nga yi'ga yake. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Bai, kati mu'lu' kanisa mwalinnyu'wa Kilisitu, nyinyonyo na alwawa, bapalikwa kwayu'wa asengo babe kwa kila kili'be.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Na mwenga mwanalu'me, mwapende ayumbo binu kati mu'lu' Kilisitu mwaalipendi kanisa na kuupiya bwu'mi wake kwa kitumbu sake. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Aapangite nnya li'nga alipeleteye kanisa kwa liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' na kuligu'lwa kwa masi' ga ubatiso, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />li'nga apate kwiletya kanisa lyaling'alang'atya lyangali malembele wala mangwinyakwinya au ulau wowoti, ila lipeleteu lyangali lukoolo. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Nyinyonyo analu'me bapalikwa kwapenda ayumbo babe kati yi'ga yabe bene. Nnalu'me ywampenda nnyumbowe, aipenda mwene. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Kwa mwanjaa ntu'pu' mundu ywaisukya yi'ga yake mwene, ila aipeya kilyo na kwikota. Na nyo, nga mu'lu' Kilisitu ngamwalipangya kanisa lyake, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />kwa mwanjaa, twenga twaili'mbi'li'mbi' ya yi'ga yake. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu panga, <char style="qt">“Kwa kitumbu si', nnalu'me aalu'a kwaleka tati' na mau' bake no lu'mbana na nnyumbowe, na abi'li' bo, baapanga yi'ga yimo.”</char> <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Mumayi'gi'yo ga kubile na iyo. Na iyo yo, inonwipe kwikwipwa, lakini nenga nibona panga mayi'gi'yo ga, galombolya bu'kana na Kilisitu na kanisa lyake. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Bai, nibwi'li'gi'ya kummakia kai' panga, kila mundu ampende nnyumbowe kati mu'lu' mwaipenda mwene. Na nnwawa nembe, apalikwa kumwisimu nsengowe.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Bana na abelei babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Mwenga mwabana, mwaayu'we abelei binu kwa ndi'la yaipendi Kilisitu Bwana, kwa mwanjaa ayi' nga aki. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Nnu'ngu' paapiyike amuli yake, yayaalongoli mulilagano yaabaike panga, <char style="qt">“Waisimu tati' bako na mau' bako.” </char> <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" /><char style="qt">“Li'nga upate yaliwa no tama masu'ba maingi padunia.”</char><verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Na mwenga mwaakinatati', kanemwasokesoke bana binu. Lakini mwalele kwa ikima na kwapeya mayi'gano gagabu'ka kwa Bwana Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abanda na angwana babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Na mwenga mwaabanda, mwayu'we angwana binu pano padunia kwa isima no lendema na kwa ugolou wa mwoyo. Mwayu'we kati mu'lu' mwamunnyu'wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Kanemwaayu'we palu' pabannola bai, li'nga bampendeli. Lakini, mutimise gapendi Nnu'ngu' kwa mwoyo woti na kwibalangilya kati mwaabanda ba Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Mupange mengo ginu kwo pulaika kati mwatumilwe ba Bwana, kwenda bandu baili. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Mutange panga, kila mundu ywapanga manogau, abe mmanda au nngwana, Bwana Yesu aalu'a kumpeya upo kwa iyendo yake inannoga.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Na mwenga mwa mabwana, nyinyonyo mwaapangi manogau abanda binu, kanemwaayogoye kwa mwanjaa mutangite, Bwana wabe na Bwana winu akwo kunani yumo bai, na mwenga mutangite panga ywembe ammawali mundu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="EPH 6:9">Ngondo ya kiloo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 6:9">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Roman soldier armor - GT00122" file="RomanSoldierInArmor_Rom13.12_GT00122.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="6:9" /> <verse eid="EPH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Kwo yomolya, muyi'me kwo kangamala no lu'mbana kwinu na Bwana kwa uweso wa makakala gake maku'lu'. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Muwale yombo yoti ya ngondo yamupeyilwe na Nnu'ngu' li'nga mupate kwiyepa ipi'li' ya Ibilisi. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Kwa mwanjaa, ngondo yitu ibu'kanali na yi'ga na myai, ila ibu'kana na kulungwa, makakala, na tawala ya api'ndo ba lubi'ndu', na mayesi ga Ibilisi abaya mudunia ya loo. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Kwa nyo, muwale yombo yoti ya ngondo yamupeyilwe na Nnu'ngu' li'nga muwese yi'ma lisu'ba lya ulau palyaisa, mana muyomwi panga goti, muyi'me kwo kangamala.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Kwa nyo, muyi'me mwakangamala ku'no mwitabite lunga lwa kweli mukibuno no wala kiibiliyo sa aki pakyuba. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Kai', kasana kwiala Abali Inannoga ya amani, ibe ilatu mumagu'lu' ginu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Bu'ka pa ago goti, imani ibe kibao so imiya njage yoti yene mwoto ya yu'lu' Ibilisi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Kai', ukosopoli wa Nnu'ngu' ube kapiya ya kyu'ma. Mutole lipanga lya Loo, ago nga mayi'gi'yo ga Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Mulu'be kwa Loo wakati woti, na kila sampuli yo lu'ba na kila samupala. Li'nga mupange nya, mupalikwa mutame wiso. Kanemuti'kwanike mwoyo. Wakati woti mwalu'bi bandu ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Kai' munilu'bi na nenga li'nga panilongela Nnu'ngu' anipei golongela, niwese longela iyo ya kweli ya Abali Inannoga pangali yogopa. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Nenga nga na yumbe wake muutabilwe. Mulu'be li'nga nipate ala kwa makakala kati mwaipalikwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu ya kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tikiko, nnongo witu na ntumisi nnyangu' ywau'bi'li'ka kwa Bwana, aalu'a kummakia kila kili'be sakinipata. Bu'kapo mwaatanga mwanibile, na sanikipanga. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Nintuma kasinu li'nga mutange mu'lu' mwatuyendelya na ansenge.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Ninu'byanga amani mwenga mwaalongo, upendo pamope na imani bu'ka kwa Tati' Nnu'ngu' na kwa Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' ibe kwa bandu boti babampenda Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu kwa upendo wangali yomoka.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>